{"id":886861,"title":"42｜插件开发环境准备","content":"在开发MySQL插件前，需先配置好开发调试环境。使用sealos平台可快速创建MySQL数据库，支持两种连接方式：直接通过sealos链接容器或通过外网地址用任何MySQL客户端连接。创建数据库后，通过命令行初始化数据库和表，如创建TestDB数据库及Finance表记录日常消费。为便于操作，可使用web工具如MySQL客户端连接数据库，输入正确的主机名、端口、用户名和密码即可。完成数据库设置后，下载Dify提供的对应操作系统版本的CLI工具，并赋予执行权限。此外，还需安装并配置Python环境，确保其正确添加到系统路径中。至此，开发与运行所需的环境配置完毕。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":404750,"user_name":"幽弥狂","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1019807,"ip_address":"天津","ucode":"5AECEA7D6ADF33","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/8f/9f/e49b68ea.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1768471474,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":1,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"推荐：https:&#47;&#47;run.claw.cloud&#47;   每月免费5美元，基本够用了","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":401207,"user_name":"峻萧Peyton","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3883792,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"FCAC0C786F49C9","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/3b/43/10/1c2731df.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1751211691,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"老师，可以说下您用的是哪一个MySQL界面管理工具吗？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1823594,"avatar":"http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/5xHXQrYSQcBb3bKOJwyIxWIqlu6lBp4jg0kweZeUoj0bMPWSkMEI74am1M0G1VfZiaoqwcZIeZeNDKZIaiarFKNA/132","nickname":"徐相韡","note":"","ucode":"6C3FEB28D5C222","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":674460,"discussion_content":"纠结这个干嘛， 这个工具自己习惯哪个用哪个","content_length":61,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1763700819,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"重庆","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_numb